# Add your own .caddyfile files to this directory. They are imported at
# the top of /etc/frankenphp/Caddyfile, so you can define custom snippets.
# Use caddyfile-global.d/ for global options.
# Use caddyfile-server.d/ to add directives to your app's site instead.
# Use caddyfile.d/ to define extra site blocks.
#
# This file only exists so the import glob matches something. Caddy logs
# "No files matching import glob pattern" on every start when a directory
# like this one is empty.
